WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.160
Welcome to Flinch.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.160
You eight players are about to have
your bravery pushed to the max.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.280
What the...

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.480
Flinches have consequences.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.520
Pain for you...

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:19.560
and points for us.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.480
Yes!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.160
The person who flinches the least
will be crowned the winner.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.480
-Are you ready?
-No, not ready.

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:27.760
Let the games begin.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.600
Oh, my God.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:39.840
Oh, my...

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:41.120
This is psychotic.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.160
No!

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.080
That's a flinch.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.120
Flinch!

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.840
FLINCH

